# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; this file is not.

# Web3Forms access key for the /contact form.
#
# Without it the contact page still builds and still works: it renders the
# email address, the availability block and the profile links, and the form is
# omitted entirely rather than shipped in a state where it would silently fail.
#
# PUBLIC_ is the correct Astro prefix here rather than a slip. The value has to
# reach the browser to be posted, so naming it PUBLIC_ states that plainly
# instead of implying a secret is being kept.
#
# The key ends up in the built HTML, and that is by design rather than an
# oversight. A Web3Forms access key only authorises delivery to the single
# address it was registered with, so a third party who copies it can send mail
# to Kishan and to nobody else. It is a routing token, not a credential.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY= 056b5ba0-8ca5-4867-8cbc-dd4296bef02f
